| `launcher.durations_file` | string | `.launch/durations.json` | a repo-relative POSIX path, no `..`, that `.gitignore` ignores and no symlink reaches | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `main` | Moves the git-ignored file of each launch key's last recorded run, which decides whether an unlisted script is long. Absent means every unlisted script is unknown, which counts as long; unreadable or malformed means the same. A path git would list, or one reached through a symlink, is refused with exit 2. | the list of scripts known to be long: `launcher.long_scripts` | always |
